Do you have a climate plan? It's going to be to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.680 --> 00:03:00.960
rip up Joe Biden's Green New Deal. I think at&nbsp;
the end of the day, we need to embrace American&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:07.080
