very difficult to actually make that a believable,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:58.440
believable argument. So as I've said before,&nbsp;
not ready for primetime does not have winner&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.440 --> 00:04:05.520
